    "• 下午茶时间，适合与自己对话。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Teestunde am Nachmittag ist gut für ein Gespräch mit dir selbst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Afternoon tea is a good time to speak with yourself."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• La hora del té es buena para conversar contigo mismo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• L'heure du thé est propice à une conversation avec soi-même."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 午後のお茶の時間は、自分と話すのにちょうどいい。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 애프터눈 티 시간은 나 자신과 대화하기 좋아."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• A hora do chá da tarde é boa para conversar consigo mesma."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 下午茶时间，适合与自己对话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 下午茶時間，適合與自己對話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 世界还在沉睡，而你已在路上。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Die Welt schläft noch, doch du bist schon unterwegs."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• The world is still asleep, and you are already on your way."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• El mundo aún duerme, y tú ya vas en camino."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Le monde dort encore, et toi, tu es déjà en route."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 世界はまだ眠っているのに、あなたはもう歩き出している。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 세상은 아직 잠들어 있지만, 너는 이미 길 위에 있어."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• O mundo ainda dorme, e você já está a caminho."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 世界还在沉睡，而你已在路上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 世界還在沉睡，而你已在路上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 今夜星光为你守护。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Heute Nacht wacht das Sternenlicht über dich."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Tonight, starlight watches over you."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Esta noche, la luz de las estrellas cuida de ti."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Ce soir, la lumière des étoiles veille sur toi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 今夜の星明かりが、あなたを見守ってくれる。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 오늘 밤 별빛이 너를 지켜 줄 거야."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Esta noite, a luz das estrelas cuida de você."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 今夜星光为你守护。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 今夜星光為你守護。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 今夜月色真美，风也温柔。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Der Mond ist heute Nacht schön, und der Wind ist sanft."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• The moon is beautiful tonight, and the wind is gentle too."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• La luna está hermosa esta noche, y el viento también es suave."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• La lune est belle ce soir, et le vent est doux lui aussi."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 今夜の月はきれいで、風もやさしい。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 오늘 밤 달빛이 참 예쁘고, 바람도 다정해."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• A lua está linda esta noite, e o vento também é suave."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 今夜月色真美，风也温柔。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 今夜月色真美，風也溫柔。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• 今日份的美好，正在派送中。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Die Schönheit des heutigen Tages ist schon unterwegs."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Today's little joys are already on their way."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Las cosas bonitas de hoy ya vienen en camino."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• Les douceurs du jour sont déjà en route."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 今日の素敵なものは、ただいま配達中。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• 오늘의 좋은 것들이 배송 중이야."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "• As belezas de hoje já estão a caminho."
