    "VIP 期间可直接使用魔法配色；若你已经单独花喵币解锁，就算 VIP 到期也不会关闭。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Waehrend VIP kannst du Magische Farben direkt nutzen. Wenn du sie separat mit Miau-Muenzen freigeschaltet hast, bleiben sie auch nach VIP-Ablauf aktiv."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "During VIP, Magic Colors are available directly. If you already unlocked them separately with Meow Coins, they will stay available even after VIP expires."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante VIP, puedes usar Colores magicos directamente. Si ya los desbloqueaste con monedas Miau, seguiran disponibles tras vencer VIP."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pendant le VIP, les Couleurs magiques sont disponibles directement. Si vous les avez deja debloquees avec des pieces Miaou, elles restent actives apres expiration du VIP."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIP 期間中は魔法カラーを直接使えます。ニャーコインで個別に解除済みの場合、VIP 期限後も使えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIP 기간에는 마법 색상을 바로 사용할 수 있습니다. 야옹 코인으로 따로 해제했다면 VIP가 만료되어도 닫히지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Durante o VIP, Cores magicas ficam disponiveis diretamente. Se voce ja desbloqueou com Moedas Miau, elas continuam mesmo apos o VIP expirar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIP 期间可直接使用魔法配色；若你已经单独花喵币解锁，就算 VIP 到期也不会关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIP 期間可直接使用魔法配色；若你已經單獨花喵幣解鎖，就算 VIP 到期也不會關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
