    "为 Pink House 换一枚更贴近心情的图标。经典、礼服、珍珠与月光风格都可以收藏，桌面也能保持你喜欢的样子。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gib Pink House ein Symbol, das besser zu deiner Stimmung passt. Klassische, Kleid-, Perlen- und Mondlicht-Stile lassen sich sammeln, damit dein Home-Bildschirm so bleibt, wie du ihn magst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Give Pink House an icon that better matches your mood. Classic, dress, pearl, and moonlight styles can all be collected, so your Home Screen keeps the look you love."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dale a Pink House un icono que encaje mejor con tu animo. Puedes coleccionar estilos clasico, vestido, perlas y luz de luna para que tu pantalla de inicio mantenga el aspecto que te gusta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Offrez a Pink House une icone plus proche de votre humeur. Les styles classique, robe, perle et clair de lune peuvent etre collectionnes pour garder l'ecran d'accueil a votre gout."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pink Houseに気分に合うアイコンを選びましょう。クラシック、ドレス、パール、月光スタイルを集めて、ホーム画面も好きな雰囲気に。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pink House에 지금 기분과 더 잘 어울리는 아이콘을 입혀 보세요. 클래식, 드레스, 진주, 달빛 스타일을 모두 모아 홈 화면도 좋아하는 모습으로 유지할 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dê ao Pink House um icone que combine melhor com seu humor. Voce pode colecionar estilos classico, vestido, perolas e luar para manter a Tela de Inicio com o visual que voce gosta."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为 Pink House 换一枚更贴近心情的图标。经典、礼服、珍珠与月光风格都可以收藏，桌面也能保持你喜欢的样子。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為 Pink House 換一枚更貼近心情的圖示。經典、禮服、珍珠與月光風格都可以收藏，桌面也能保持你喜歡的樣子。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为了让这套主题更完整，已帮你切回纯色背景；停用主题后可再使用图片背景。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To keep this theme consistent, the background was switched back to a solid color. You can use image backgrounds again after disabling the theme."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了让这套主题更完整，已帮你切回纯色背景；停用主题后可再使用图片背景。"
          }
