    "后续会持续补充主题皮肤商店、周报与更多会员限定内容。" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Theme-Skin-Shop-Vorteile, Wochenberichte und weitere Mitgliederinhalte werden fortlaufend ausgebaut."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Theme Skin Store perks, weekly reports, and more member-only content will keep expanding."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los beneficios de la tienda de skins, informes semanales y mas contenido exclusivo seguiran creciendo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les avantages de la boutique de skins, les rapports hebdomadaires et plus de contenu membre continueront de s'enrichir."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "テーマスキンストア特典、週報、さらに多くの会員限定コンテンツを今後も追加します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "테마 스킨 상점 혜택, 주간 리포트, 더 많은 회원 전용 콘텐츠가 계속 추가됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
